// Lossless Concrete Syntax Tree (CST) Trivia Collection, Normalization, and
// 5-Slot Deterministic Attachment Engine (T805 / E19.2).
// Implements SPEC-101 §3 (AXS-FMT-001..004, REQ-TOOL-183, REQ-TOOL-298, INV-FMT-001).
module compiler.fmt.cst

